      "content": "that actually makes sense when you put it that way. it feels like i've been exhausted just trying to meet these standards of \"existing\" when it's all just a temporary resistance to what's naturally going to happen. it's weirdly comforting to think that maybe just giving up the struggle isn't a failure, but maybe just... accepting the physics of it.",
